## Command

```shell
biome format --write file.astro
```

## `biome.json`

```json
{
  "html": {
    "formatter": { "enabled": true },
    "experimentalFullSupportEnabled": true
  }
}
```

## `file.astro`

```astro
---
const x = 5;
---

<div>{/* a note */}</div>
<div class={/* a note */}>{x}</div>

```

# Emitted Messages

```block
Formatted 1 file in <TIME>. Fixed 1 file.
```
